---
title: Conversational book discovery
---
sequenceDiagram
	actor Customer
	participant Client as AG-UI client
	participant Chat as Chat API
	participant Validation as Input validation
	participant DecisionRouter as Decision Router (Microsoft-Decision-1)
	participant Book as Book Agent
	participant CatalogResearcher as Book Catalog Researcher
	participant RecommendationResearcher as Book Recommendation Researcher
	participant MCP as MCP tools
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant QA as QA Agent

	Customer ->> Client: Ask a book-discovery question
	Client ->> Chat: Submit request to /ag-ui
	Chat ->> Validation: Start chat workflow

	alt Input rejected
		Validation -->> Chat: Rejection response
		Chat -->> Client: Format and return response
		Client -->> Customer: Show rejection
	else Input accepted
		Validation ->> DecisionRouter: Evaluate language, scope & route

		alt Book discovery
			DecisionRouter ->> Book: Route to Book workflow

			alt Straightforward request
				Book ->> MCP: Request scoped Catalog information
				MCP ->> Catalog: Read book facts
				Catalog -->> MCP: Book information
				MCP -->> Book: Tool result
			else Complex independent research
				par Book facts
					Book ->> CatalogResearcher: Delegate book-fact research
					CatalogResearcher ->> MCP: Request Catalog information
					MCP ->> Catalog: Read book facts
					Catalog -->> MCP: Book information
					MCP -->> CatalogResearcher: Tool result
					CatalogResearcher -->> Book: Research findings
				and Recommendations
					Book ->> RecommendationResearcher: Delegate recommendation research
					RecommendationResearcher ->> MCP: Request Catalog information
					MCP ->> Catalog: Read book facts
					Catalog -->> MCP: Book information
					MCP -->> RecommendationResearcher: Tool result
					RecommendationResearcher -->> Book: Recommendation findings
				end
				Book ->> Book: Synthesize research results
			end
			Book -->> Chat: Format and return response
		else Store or account question
			DecisionRouter ->> QA: Route to QA workflow
			QA -->> Chat: Format and return response
		else Unsupported or non-English request
			DecisionRouter -->> Chat: Short-circuit boundary response
		end
		Chat -->> Client: Return response
		Client -->> Customer: Show answer
	end
